<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Reconstructed from the "Torneos — Alarmas" design canvas (Main.dc.html,
  illustration band: court + racket + basketball + dashed trajectory + ball),
  the same source used for the web empty-state-doodle component — not redrawn
  by hand. Both dashed curves (hero trajectory "7 8" and basketball bounce arc
  "3 6") were resampled along their original bezier/quadratic curves and
  rebuilt as discrete dash segments, since VectorDrawable has no
  stroke-dasharray. The Gaussian-blur glow filter has no VectorDrawable
  equivalent either; the radial/linear gradients' own alpha falloff carries
  the glow.
-->
